WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.033
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.033
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.033
Thank you for being here.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.100
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.300
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.000
Well, guys, there's a lot
going on in the news.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.367
Today the FDA approved Pfizer
and Moderna booster shots.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:17.367
Not only that,
a jury in Wisconsin

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:18.701
approved gunshots.

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:21.934
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:24.367
Yeah, today, Kyle Rittenhouse
was found not guilty

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:26.434
on all five counts
in the shooting

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:27.801
that killed two men
and injured one

00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:30.000
during last year's
racial justice protests

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.133
in Kenosha, Wisconsin.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:33.968
It just goes to show you can
do anything in this country,

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:35.467
as long as you're in the white.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.434
[ Laughter and applause ]
On the --

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:38.501
On the right.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:39.767
No, in the right.

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.534
Let's move on
to some lighter news.

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:44.200
It was a big day
for President Biden.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.267
This morning,
he went to Walter Reed

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.467
for a routine physical
and a colonoscopy.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:50.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.868
I guess Biden's
infrastructure plan means all

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:54.334
of the tunnels
are getting worked on tonight.

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:58.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:02.033
[ Cheering ]

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:04.167
Yeah, but it wasn't
a typical colonoscopy.

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:05.467
-Really?!
-No.

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:07.667
Before the procedure,
Biden started talking

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:10.567
and the anesthesiologist
fell asleep.
-Oh.

00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:13.934
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:16.267
The anesthesiologist.

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:17.901
Colonoscopies can be
a little invasive.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:20.133
That's why, before the
procedure, Biden was like --

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:24.033
-[Adele] ♪ Go easy ♪

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.100
♪ On me, baby ♪

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.200
[ Laughter ]
-But get this --

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.033
Well, after his procedure,
Biden took part

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:32.701
in the annual presidential
turkey pardoning

00:01:32.701 --> 00:01:34.701
and last night
the two lucky turkeys stayed

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:36.968
in their own suite
at the Willard Hotel.

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:38.234
Here they are.
This is real.

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:40.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:42.367
Yeah. Even weirder,

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.667
it was the fantasy suite.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.868 --> 00:01:47.100
I heard that,
after their pardon,

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.367
most presidential turkeys go

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:49.634
to live the rest of their days

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:52.167
on a farm in Virginia
called Gobblers Rest.

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:54.033
[ Laughter ]
And, believe it or not,

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.400
all those pardoned turkeys
actually have

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.200
their own reality show.
Watch this.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.601
[ Suspenseful music plays ]
-Coming up on the next...

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:04.734
...Marshmallow throws down
the gantlet with Budge.

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:05.968
-[ Gobbling ]

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:08.567
-Carrot gets drunk
and belligerent at brunch.

00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:10.467
-[ Gobbling ]
[Bleep]

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:14.000
-And Butterscotch throws
Caramel's prosthetic claw.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.767
-[ Gobbling ]

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:17.868
♪♪

00:02:17.868 --> 00:02:19.434
-Hosted by Nick Cannon.

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:20.501
-Ah, interesting.

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:21.567
What?!

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:24.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:28.667
Some more news
from Washington --

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:29.934
today the House passed Biden's

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:32.601
nearly $2 trillion
Build Back Better Act.

00:02:32.601 --> 00:02:35.834
And here's Speaker Nancy Pelosi
making the big announcement.

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:43.901
-On this vote, the yeas are 220,
the nays are 213.

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:46.834
The Build Back Better bill
is passed.

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:47.934
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:51.801
[ Hooting ]

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:53.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:54.701
-Yeah.

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:56.634
Asked if that dancing
was awkward,

00:02:56.634 --> 00:02:58.100
the yeas were unanimous.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.334 --> 00:03:02.267
♪♪

00:03:02.267 --> 00:03:03.667
Meanwhile,
Democrats actually planned

00:03:03.667 --> 00:03:05.100
to vote on the bill
last night,

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.334
but House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:09.267
gave the longest
continuous speech

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:12.133
in House history to stall it.
This is real.

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:14.434
He talked for eight
straight hours.
[ Audience ohs ]

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:16.467
Just listen to a little bit
of what he said. It's real.

00:03:16.467 --> 00:03:19.334
-Picture America at a swim meet

00:03:19.334 --> 00:03:20.734
after World War II.

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:22.100
I was in the sixth grade.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.567
I turn on the TV.

00:03:23.567 --> 00:03:25.133
I watch Jimmy Carter

00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:26.334
have a sweater on

00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:27.934
and tell me
to turn the heater down.

00:03:27.934 --> 00:03:29.367
You ever eaten one
of these baby carrots?

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:30.567
They're just big carrots
they chop

00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:31.834
and they charge you more
when you buy them.

00:03:31.834 --> 00:03:33.601
Personally, I didn't think
I could go this long.

00:03:33.601 --> 00:03:36.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.334
-He did that for eight hours.

00:03:38.334 --> 00:03:39.567
On the bright side,
when they heard

00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:41.167
