for eight hours straight,

00:03:41.167 --> 00:03:42.667
Uber was like, "You're hired."

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:44.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.701 --> 00:03:46.200
Some business news --
I saw that Oprah

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:50.300
